		"note": "Resolving a coordinator is arithmetic over the group id, not a lookup of group state: a group that does not exist yet still has the broker that would own it. v4 is also a batch API — every key gets its own error_code and the top-level error_code stays 0, which is what lets a client resolve several groups in one round trip.",
